  "content": "[Verse 1]\n[A]I remember well\nthe smell of te-\n[D]quila\n[A]One bed, one bath,\ntwo months with\n[C#m]Steph\nDrinkin' up\n[D]the\nsunrise\n[E]Then sleep 'till\neight at night I\n[A]had a ten day birth-\nday 'till Thanks-\n[D]giving [Dsus4]\n[D]\n[A]We burnt the bird\nand hit the\n[C#m]road [F#m]\n[A][D]Blur in ste-\nre-\no,\n[E]sonic book-\nmarks and bad\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[A]scenes\nBut not a dull\n[C#m]moment,\n[F#m]I barely [E]miss\nliving [D]in\nLos [E]Angeles\n\n[Verse 2]\n[A]Only took a week\nto start the\n[D]warfare\n[A]Eccentric neigh-\nbors on wel-\n[C#m]fare [F#m]\n[A][D]The turntable\nspun\nto the beat of\n[E]pounding\non the walls We'd\n[A]sink another drink\nwith Billy\n[D]Idol\n[Dsus2]  [D]\n[A]Have sloppy sex\non the living room\n[C#m]floor\n[C#m]A whirlwind of\n[D]simple\npleasure princi-\n[E]pal\nPrinciples are\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[A5]gone\nIt's not a dull\n[C#m]moment\n[F#5]I barely [E5]miss\nliving [D5]in\nthat selfish [E5]bliss\nwith\n\n[Chorus]\n[F#5]Steph And I\n[D5]always have the\n[A5]past to be\n[E5]warned\n[F#5]And I\n[D5]always knew the\n[A5]last laugh was\n[E5]more\n[G5]And I can taste\n[E5]the gold ring\n[D5]tarnish in my\n[F#5]mouth\nAnd I need a\n[G5]drink\n[A5]to wash it out\n\n[Outro]\nIt's not a dull\nmoment\n[B5]I barely miss\n[A5]living in\n[G5]that state of filth\n[A5][B5]So I [C#5]\n[D5]cleaned the yard, the\nyard, the yard\n[F#m]Mow the lawn,\nscrub the stained\n[Bm]rug So\n[A]what? It's\n[G]safe and\n[A/D]sound I have\n[D]found",
